1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,744
The common ion effect.

2
00:00:01,744 --> 00:00:10,794
If you add a strong electrolyte that supplies an ion already present in a weak equilibrium, that equilibrium is pushed back.

3
00:00:10,794 --> 00:00:15,026
It is simply Le Chatelier's principle, applied to ions.

